<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets Hongkong Land warrants.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets Hongkong Land warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Thursday it has launched 94 million American-style call warrants on Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$2.3850	  PREMIUM	 16 PCT</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    US$2.65	    GEARING	 3.85X</p>
<p> MATURITY	    20.NOV.98	  MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.5330 (using FX rate of 7.7365)</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SETTLEMENT	  PHYSICAL SHARES WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p>ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
